@0x4007 
That 2% fee is used solely in the test files.
Mint and redeem fees were [set](https://github.com/ubiquity/ubiquity-dollar/blob/e4c1fae5ef5e9ba40bcb84c671f2ba39f0ab5208/packages/contracts/migrations/development/Deploy001_Diamond_Dollar_Governance.s.sol#L316-L317) to 0% on deployment + they are adjustable.

